# LuaLS definition stubs (engine.d.lua, editor.d.lua) are generated offline by the
# ApiDocGen tool from the sol3 binding sources, then committed here so a fresh clone
# has completions without building or running anything:
#   python Source/Tools/ApiDocGen/generate_api_docs.py --src Source/LuaScript             --out rbfxProjs/EmptyTest/_apidocs/engine.d.lua
#   python Source/Tools/ApiDocGen/generate_api_docs.py --src Source/Editor/EditorLuaScript --out rbfxProjs/EmptyTest/_apidocs/editor.d.lua
# Regenerate after adding or renaming bindings. They are kept out of the resource tree on
# purpose so the packer never ships them; Data/Scripts and EditorScripts .luarc.json pull
# this directory in through workspace.library.
